^{:go/pos {:doc [1815 1] :tok-pos [1828 1]}} (go/type ^{:go/pos {:name-pos [1828 6]}} PyExpat_CAPI "PyExpat_CAPI is struct PyExpat_CAPI: its fields in C's order, the function pointers as Go funcs of the expat\nport's signatures.\n\nWhat _elementtree (Modules/_elementtree.c, not ported) takes from it, for its later port: it reads the capsule\npyexpat.expat_CAPI (PyCapsule_Import, here the capsule's pointer field), checks magic == PyExpat_CAPI_MAGIC,\nsize >= sizeof(struct PyExpat_CAPI) and MAJOR/MINOR/MICRO_VERSION equal to its own expat.h's, then calls through\nit (its EXPAT(st, func) macro): ParserCreate_MM, ParserFree, SetUserData, SetElementHandler,\nSetCharacterDataHandler, SetCommentHandler, SetProcessingInstructionHandler, SetDefaultHandlerExpand,\nSetNamespaceDeclHandler, SetStartDoctypeDeclHandler, SetUnknownEncodingHandler with\nDefaultUnknownEncodingHandler, SetEncoding, SetHashSalt16Bytes (else SetHashSalt), SetReparseDeferralEnabled,\nParse, GetErrorCode, GetErrorLineNumber, GetErrorColumnNumber and ErrorString. Its handlers raise into the same\nerror indicator (pyexpatErrSet; its parse checks pyexpatErrOccurred as _elementtree checks PyErr_Occurred) and\nDefaultUnknownEncodingHandler is PyUnknownEncodingHandler, which sets it.\n" ^{:go/pos {:lbrace [1828 26] :rbrace [1866 1] :struct [1828 19]}} (struct
